    <div class = "aboutusMain">
        <h1>ABOUT The Blog</h1>
        
        <div class = "aboutusContent">
            <!-- calculate my age -->
            <%
                var dob = new Date(1995, 9, 26);
                var diff_ms = Date.now() - dob.getTime();
                var age_dt = new Date(diff_ms); 
                var age = Math.abs(age_dt.getUTCFullYear() - 1970);
            %>
            <p>Hello, My name is Chris Cossich and I created this site so that I could be able to share my experiences with you. Ever since I had the privelage to go out and do things on my 
                own or with friends, I have tried to make the most of it.
            </p>
            <p>
                Im <%= age %> years old, and live and work in the D.C area. I Graudated from George Mason University in the fall of 2019 with a Bachelors Degree in Information Technology. Currently,
                I'm a software engineer and love building and working on websites. I found an interest in development when i was in high school, and have continued to expand my knowledge 
                whenever I have the time. Lately, I've been enjoying working with wordpress and building custom themes using php and even getting into Gutenberg Blocks using React.js
            </p>
            <p>Originally, I thought sharing my expereinces through Instagram and other social media would get the job done. However, I beleive that creating this site is a great way to 
                expand my audience.
            </p>
            <p>As an individual who is striving to get into the world of front-end development, I created this site as a way to show some of the skills I have aquired throughout my time learning
                how to code. For those who are into development. This site, was developed using Node.js. It utilized MongoDb as its database management for the posts, comments, and users.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>


